Description: An independently installable implementation of the CellChat interface at
    commit 75253cd0c9e68410e6e721a6d3a0419a1d7e358f. Rust kernels accelerate numerical
    inference while bundled R implementations preserve the complete public interface,
    datasets, spatial neighbour algorithm, and original S4 class provenance. Does not
    require an installation of the original CellChat package.
